  "generated_model": "##### Objective Function:\n\n$\\quad \\min \\sum_{i=1}^{12} \\sum_{j=1}^{12} c_{ij} x_{ij}$\n\nwhere $c_{ij}$ is the machining cost of assigning machine $i$ to task $j$, and $x_{ij}$ is a binary variable equal to 1 if machine $i$ is assigned to task $j$, 0 otherwise.\n\n##### Constraints\n\n###### 1. Assignment Constraints:\n\nEach machine is assigned to exactly one task:\n$$\n\\sum_{j=1}^{12} x_{ij} = 1 \\quad \\forall i \\in \\{1,2,\\ldots,12\\}\n$$\n\nEach task is assigned to exactly one machine:\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^{12} x_{ij} = 1 \\quad \\forall j \\in \\{1,2,\\ldots,12\\}\n$$\n\n###### 2. Variable Constraints:\n\n$$\nx_{ij} \\in \\{0,1\\} \\quad \\forall i,j\n$$\n\n##### Retrieved Information\n\n{\n  \"cost\": {\n    \"M1\":   {\"A\": 167.4, \"B\": 98.6,  \"C\": 189.4, \"D\": 119.6, \"E\": 182.0, \"F\": 145.1, \"G\": 185.4, \"H\": 94.8,  \"I\": 122.3, \"J\": 123.3, \"K\": 96.1,  \"L\": 90.3},\n    \"M2\":   {\"A\": 156.2, \"B\": 88.7,  \"C\": 187.3, \"D\": 124.7, \"E\": 173.2, \"F\": 144.3, \"G\": 179.0, \"H\": 91.5,  \"I\": 115.1, \"J\": 119.5, \"K\": 100.1, \"L\": 88.6},\n    \"M3\":   {\"A\": 184.3, \"B\": 121.0, \"C\": 216.6, \"D\": 140.0, \"E\": 196.2, \"F\": 168.8, \"G\": 205.6, \"H\": 114.2, \"I\": 133.3, \"J\": 144.5, \"K\": 116.0, \"L\": 107.7},\n    \"M4\":   {\"A\": 157.9, \"B\": 92.9,  \"C\": 185.1, \"D\": 120.3, \"E\": 175.1, \"F\": 146.2, \"G\": 180.8, \"H\": 86.3,  \"I\": 111.6, \"J\": 115.9, \"K\": 98.1,  \"L\": 91.1},\n    \"M5\":   {\"A\": 175.6, \"B\": 103.6, \"C\": 204.5, \"D\": 130.0, \"E\": 192.8, \"F\": 157.5, \"G\": 194.2, \"H\": 106.9, \"I\": 129.9, \"J\": 134.9, \"K\": 105.8, \"L\": 98.6},\n    \"M6\":   {\"A\": 166.8, \"B\": 107.0, \"C\": 199.2, \"D\": 130.4, \"E\": 183.6, \"F\": 159.5, \"G\": 187.0, \"H\": 98.2,  \"I\": 121.3, \"J\": 126.2, \"K\": 105.9, \"L\": 101.8},\n    \"M7\":   {\"A\": 159.7, \"B\": 93.2,  \"C\": 183.8, \"D\": 113.0, \"E\": 171.9, \"F\": 139.1, \"G\": 169.6, \"H\": 85.1,  \"I\": 110.0, \"J\"